# Build contexts are the repository root (the API links the desktop's crates
# and bakes content/ into its image). Keep everything else out: target
# directories alone are gigabytes.
#
# Anchor build-output patterns to where Cargo actually puts them. A loose
# `**/target-*` once matched content/problems/target-sum and silently dropped
# a problem from the image; `dsa-api check-content` now fails the build if a
# catalogued problem has no pack.
/target
/backend/target
/backend/target-*
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.env
web/dist
infra/cdk.out
/dist
.claude
